# Binaries
/server
/server.exe

# SQLite database and dynamic config data
data/
backend/data/
3m-ui.db

# Logs
*.log
backend_run.log

# Generated embedded frontend: every official target (make frontend-assets,
# release-build.yml, Dockerfile) rebuilds and replaces this directory. Only a
# self-contained placeholder index.html is tracked, so a bare `go build` on a
# fresh clone still compiles (//go:embed needs the directory to be non-empty)
# and serves an actionable page instead of a blank one. The placeholder must
# stay dependency-free — never reference built asset hashes from here.
/cmd/server/web/dist/*
!/cmd/server/web/dist/index.html
